        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(e) Lump Sum: You may elect to receive 10% to 60% of your pension benefit in a lump sum payment, with the remainder paid under one of the optional annuities, above. Effective January 1, 2001, retirees can elect to receive up to 70% of their pension benefit in a lump sum payment. The minimum amount of any lump sum remains at 10%.",
            "block_bbox": [
                214,
