        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(j) Lifetime Annuity – Employees who were at least age 55 on December 4, 1988 and who attained at least 30 years of credited service before December 1, 1991 will receive a lifetime annuity of $50.00 per month starting at age 62 if the employee retires prior to age 62, or at the time of retirement if the employee retires after age 62.",
